*** Settings ***
Documentation       Technical helper keywords for apps. Only here are keywords of the AppiumLibrary used.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/abilities/mobile_ability.resource
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/pages/android_settings_page.resource
Keyword Tags        interaction


*** Keywords ***
Launch App
    [Documentation]    Starts the app on the Android device or emulator.
    Open Application    ${APPIUM_SERVER_URL}
    ...    platformName=Android
    ...    appium:automationName=UiAutomator2
    ...    appium:appPackage=${ANDROID_APP_PACKAGE}
    ...    appium:appActivity=${ANDROID_APP_ACTIVITY}

Close Apps
    [Documentation]    Closes all started apps.
    Close All Applications

Build Mobile Selector
    [Documentation]    Puts a text into a selector with the placeholder {text}.
    [Arguments]    ${template}    ${text}
    ${selector}    Format String    ${template}    text=${text}
    RETURN    ${selector}

Tap On
    [Documentation]    Waits for an element and taps it.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    ${selector}
    Click Element    ${selector}

Wait For Visible Element
    [Documentation]    Waits until an element is visible.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    ${selector}
